            "text": "noncomputable def streamPotential (d a b M : ℝ) (ell : S → ℝ) (v : PressureStream.Plane)\n    (f : PressureStream.Lift S → ℝ) : PressureStream.Lift S → ℝ :=\n  PressureStream.divideRadius (compactPrimitive d a b M ell v (PressureStream.weightedSource f))"
